	)
	(text "U100: STM32G0B1KET6N, N suffix. Pin 20 is VDDIO2, tied to VDD.\nPA11/PA12 allocation retained; USB/LSE unused. Verify UCPD reset configuration."
		(at 180.34 62.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4cf4a037-7508-4b8e-a4ad-2c18d7e50be9")
	)
	(text "J100: logical SWD access; physical connector unselected.\n1 VTref sense only, 2 SWDIO, 3 SWCLK, 4 NRST, 5 GND.\nNo injected probe power. Power-off/backfeed review open."
		(at 254 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ec985fc-d520-4c84-ad9e-71dcf12951ac")
	)
	(text "16 MHz HSE bypass; no passive crystal.\nPlace C110/C111 locally at Y100 in layout; source-series option open."
		(at 25.4 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "123f91f8-6bdc-4b80-b91d-4f1b7aa6b1ce")
	)
	(text "OPEN: ADC conditioning, local charger I2C, isolated pack SMBus,\nUART, interlock status and payload request. Required pins remain unconnected.\nNo EPS drive on IHU-owned COMMS_EN / PAYLOAD_EN or stack alert."
		(at 25.4 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "74b1397b-2bfc-4e55-9ac8-a936fbe62bb4")
	)
	(text "PD3 reserved. Do not connect BMS BTP directly to 3V3 logic.\nUnused BTP is tied to BMS VSS in the proposed BMS circuit; poll pack status."
		(at 25.4 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "88e5ec46-9db9-4814-919a-015a5cecdfa1")
	)
	(text "S11 OPEN: metadata is saved; required visible field styling unsupported.\nS08: reused TCAN/ECS custom symbols remain under original construction review."
		(at 25.4 224.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4121b165-048e-4506-a598-8aa1b1bb04f7")
	)
	(text "Essential+3V3 comes from buck; converters use external SYS fixture. Solar VIN_CHG ends at future charger; BMS pending."
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "70a1dab9-33d4-4685-9273-f5480baf4a73")
	)
	(text "PROTECTION INTERFACES — LINKED GLOBALS\nPA6 REC5_RESET ->47k R623 ->Q609; existing100k base pull-down.\nPA7 REC5_FAULT; PC15 SRC_FAULT:active-low, single47k pullups on protector sheets.\nReset2ms; >=10s cooldown plus real rail qualification and settling.\nReset never bypasses hardware protection."
		(at 254 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "47bc76e3-6857-4021-83af-1c4dd7f088b2")
	)
	(text "2026-10-24: OLD SOURCE / CHARGER-I2C NOTES ARE OBSOLETE."
